# Wave T28 (Fairhaven kit): tideboard — the tide-table board at
# the quay (MANIFEST row 42; BACKSTORY-SYNC-AUDIT Fairhaven:
# "tide-table board at the quay" — the market has priced by the
# tide for a hundred years). A harbour-blue board on two posts:
# pale wave lines, a sun glyph and a moon glyph, chalk tide
# ticks — MARKS, NOT WORDS (the Mistford chalkboard ruling: no
# invented text; the tide-pricing story is the harbour sign's +
# ANA's shipped words). FULLY OPAQUE by design: tg-slateport
# (measured flat #248917, with its shading derivatives) is baked
# in as its ground, never transparency (the T27 precedent).
# Stands at (16,15), paired with the shipped HARBOR sign.
PIX tile-prop-tideboard 16 16
